# 🔧 Makwenje Plumbing – Reactified

A modern React + TypeScript conversion of the Makwenje Plumbing company website, originally built with Yii2. The site preserves the original dark gold/black aesthetic, custom glowing navigation, and all interactive features (gallery slideshow, lightbox, flip cards) — now fully client‑side.

