## 📁 Project Structure

```
src/
├── assets/            # Static images (not used directly in code)
├── components/
│   ├── layout/        # Header, Footer, Layout (dark theme shell)
│   └── ui/            # Reusable UI components (Slideshow, Lightbox)
├── pages/             # Route‑level components (Home, About, Contact)
├── router/            # React Router configuration
├── styles/            # Global CSS (dark theme, font reset)
├── types/             # Shared TypeScript types
└── utils/             # Utility functions (if needed)
